{"type":"message","id":"1be9e188","parentId":"981a16fd","timestamp":"2026-03-27T06:10:54.515Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a heartbeat prompt. I need to read HEARTBEAT.md from the workspace and follow it strictly.\n\nFrom the project context, I can see there is a HEARTBEAT.md file at `/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md`. Let me read it first to understand what tasks need to be done.\n\nThe heartbeat.md defines tasks:\n1. Information scanning (market news, earnings calendar, fear & greed index)\n2. Signal generation (technical indicators, preset signals)\n3. Paper trading simulation (update positions, calculate P&L, check stop-loss)\n4. Report generation (daily signal report, update performance.json)\n\nThe current time is Friday, March 27th, 2026 — 2:10 PM (Asia/Shanghai), which corresponds to the 18:00 scan time (晚盘扫描) according to the schedule table.\n\nSo I should:\n1. Scan market news\n2. Update technical indicators\n3. Check preset symbols for signals\n4. Generate daily signal report\n\nHowever, this is a fresh session and I don't have:\n- Preset symbols to watch\n- Existing signal files\n- Performance history\n- Paper trading setup\n\nAccording to the heartbeat instructions, I should follow the tasks. But since this is a first-time run, I need to establish the basic structure.\n\nLet me start by checking what exists and then perform the tasks I can.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll read HEARTBEAT.md and follow the tasks for this heartbeat."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d2deac66b1355cbeba87ddd6338bb","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":7247,"output":605,"cacheRead":14848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22700,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774591842716}}
{"type":"message","id":"c6efb678","parentId":"1be9e188","timestamp":"2026-03-27T06:10:54.525Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"019d2deac66b1355cbeba87ddd6338bb","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat - 每日交易信号扫描\n\n## 🎯 心跳任务\n\n每次心跳时执行以下检查:\n\n### 1. 信息扫描\n- [ ] 扫描市场新闻 (加密货币/美股/宏观)\n- [ ] 检查财报日历 (今日/明日)\n- [ ] 获取恐惧贪婪指数\n\n### 2. 信号生成\n- [ ] 更新技术面指标\n- [ ] 检查预设品种的信号\n- [ ] 记录新信号到 signals/\n\n### 3. 模拟账户\n- [ ] 更新持仓价格\n- [ ] 计算当日 P&L\n- [ ] 检查止损/止盈是否触发\n\n### 4. 报告生成\n- [ ] 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- [ ] 更新 performance.json\n\n---\n\n## 📅 扫描时间\n\n| 时间 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 08:00 | 早盘扫描 | 隔夜新闻,亚洲市场 |\n| 12:00 | 午盘扫描 | 午间更新,欧洲开盘 |\n| 18:00 | 晚盘扫描 | 美股盘中,财报更新 |\n| 22:00 | 夜盘扫描 | 收盘数据,每日报告 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔔 触发条件\n\n- 正常扫描: 每4小时\n- 重大事件: 新闻关键词触发\n- 止损触发: 模拟持仓触发止损\n\n---\n\n## 📤 输出\n\n- 信号文件: `signals/YYYY-MM-DD.json`\n- 报告文件: `reports/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 持仓更新: `paper-trading/portfolio.json`\n\n---\n\n*心跳配置版本: 1.0*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774591854523}}
